# Manual test — CSKH Inbox + Ads Insights
# Dùng VS Code REST Client hoặc copy curl. Thay {{token}} và {{conversationId}}.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3003
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
@conversationId = YOUR_CONVERSATION_UUID
@pageId = YOUR_FB_PAGE_ID

### 1. Stats inbox (tab Chưa đọc / Ads)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cskh/inbox/conversation-stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Danh sách hội thoại Ads (50 đầu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cskh/inbox/conversations?fromAdOnly=1&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Tin nhắn hội thoại (25 tin — path nhanh)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cskh/inbox/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages?limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Chi phí QC / ad insights (sidebar phải)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cskh/inbox/conversations/{{conversationId}}/ad-insights
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. AI intent
GET {{baseUrl}}/cskh/inbox/conversations/{{conversationId}}/intent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. OAuth ad accounts (Settings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cskh/oauth/ad-accounts-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Backfill tag Ads từ DB
POST {{baseUrl}}/cskh/inbox/backfill-ad-referrals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# --- Kỳ vọng ad-insights ---
# - Có ad_id từ webhook → insightsScope: "ad", campaignName có thể có
# - Tin cũ không ad_id → insightsScope: "page", costPerConversation TB Page 30 ngày
# - unavailableReason: "no_messaging_insights" + estimateNote → OAuth lại đúng tài khoản QC
# - unavailableReason: "no_ad_accounts" → OAuth chưa có ads_read
